{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_6_level_main_06-03_beg","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"main_06-03","title":"同時走失","storyCode":"6-3","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"fdfd7d4d7a44533e3c5138860a0deaff99e291a84ef7ca0585bb81e5e5f1d066","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"梅菲斯特施展法術，讓他的牧群變得狂躁，甚至開始了無差別攻擊。\n不忍目睹這種情況的浮士德決定出手援救己方。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcity_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛才釋放了什麼法術？你的......隊伍，比之前更狂躁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"他們......他們很痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你看到了啊？我種下去的種子開花了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的，浮士德，他們不會攻擊我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"你還在催化他們的感染？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特......停手吧。我們能活下去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"只有我的法術能做到這種事情，也只有這樣，我們才有可能逃出去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你在偵察的時候也看得很清楚了吧，如果我們以現在的狀態強行突破，近衛局在我們抵達貧民區的秘密通道之前，就能把我們全殺掉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你以前見過那些武器嗎？那些連切爾諾伯格的守衛都沒用過的武器！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"他們太熟悉這座城市了，而我們只是些外來人！他們從哪裡出現？又會在哪裡消失？！僅憑現在這點人，我們沒法與他們正面對抗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"切爾諾伯格的烏薩斯人太弱了......龍門把我們當軍隊看待，可我們不是軍隊，我們帶領著的，只是些想活下去的同胞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"聲音輕些。我們的士氣相當低落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"但我的牧群根本不會因為這種事情動搖！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......還有剛剛和我們會合的很多整合運動成員在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"霜星一定會來支援我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"霜星？那個霜星？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，呵呵，她和她的雪怪，難道不是也背叛了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"否則憑他們的實力，有什麼能攔得住他們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我不怪他們。哪怕是背叛，他們也只是為了生存。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"霜星不會背叛。我們不是說好了，要自己去看到真相？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊......大家都在為了生存而努力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"別衝動，別被近衛局的計策衝昏頭腦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我有辦法，浮士德。我可以讓我的同胞們更好地活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......？你要做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我要讓近衛局看看比軍隊更可怕的東西。他們絕對無法想像我同胞們綻放出的花朵是什麼樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"近衛局一定要為他們的所作所為付出代價......那個陳，一定要為傷害你付出代價！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我的同胞們，我的族裔們，回應我吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特的牧群","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的體內有著遠比現在更旺盛的生命......去追索那種衝動，去散播你們的種子、你們的未來吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"不，梅菲斯特！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"他們是活的人啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特的牧群","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（混亂的尖叫聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"整個龍門都是你們的土壤！去啊，去把你們的生命傳遞給其他人！快去，快去，快去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_6_7"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_6_7"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_6_7"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊？啊？！怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你，你要幹嘛？我們和你不是一個小隊的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我沒在背後說過你們什麼！也沒說梅菲斯特......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"隊長？隊長呢？！隊長！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！！怎，怎麼，你怎麼咬我！！為什麼......呃呃呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救命！！救命！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊啊，啊！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"他們比以前更強了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然他們已經聽不見我的聲音了，但他們不會再攻擊我們......他們會越來越壯、越來越強、越來越多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門會被它們徹底毀滅。哼，我的同胞們得不到龍門，龍門人也別想繼續保留這座城市！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"浮士德，走吧，我們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"浮士德？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"你做了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧群","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧群","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（痛苦的嘶嚎）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"浮士德？你去哪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"浮士德！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_uptown_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼梅菲斯特的手下在攻擊我們？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"我好像看到......糟糕，糟糕，剛才被他們拖走的伊萬......我看到了！伊萬好像也變成那種樣子了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"蘇卡，什麼怪物......這是什麼怪物！！打了他們也不會痛，刺了也不會死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"他們比剛才狂躁了好幾倍！我們已經有點打不過了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"你們，跟我來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"浮士德？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"別去，可能是梅菲斯特的陷阱！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......這小子救過我的命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特是個混蛋，他不一定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"從這裡走，快。幻影弩手會保護你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝......等，等下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"當心！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"——源石投擲物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"快走！牧群的目標是你們！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_uptown_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"灰喉，敵人的動向很奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"重裝幹員會盡力維持陣線，我們術師著重削減敵人的數量，有法術能力的感染者，就交給你和其他狙擊幹員處理了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"我射殺感染者，也是可以容許的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"灰喉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"有可能的話，我不容許任何人傷害感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，我是不是允許別人這麼做，別人是不是允許感染者傷害其他人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有任何意義。這些學說在戰場上沒有意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"如果真的有可能，沒人應該傷害他人。無論是感染者還是普通人，都一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"我會照做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾會為我們提供醫療支援，所以......注意自己的狀況，別受傷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......奇怪？那些是......梅菲斯特的牧群......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但我......我怎麼一點情感都感受不到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不對。不對！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"灰喉，快下來！事情不對！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"它們......竟然在拔出身上的源石？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"灰喉！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"博士！你沒事吧？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我沒事！你小心！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哪冒出來這麼多牧群？動作都完全變了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，你那位置還算比較安全！待在那別動！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我先把這些東西都解決了再說！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["煌"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合運動成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["梅菲斯特"]},{"speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","aliases":["浮士德"]},{"speakerId":"char_367_swllow","aliases":["灰喉"]}]}
